sequenceDiagram
    participant Pub as Publisher Service
    participant Redis as Redis Streams
    participant Rabbit as RabbitMQ
    participant Sub1 as Subscriber 1
    participant Sub2 as Subscriber 2
    participant Sub3 as Subscriber 3
    
    Note over Pub: Event occurs
    Pub->>Redis: XADD event_stream {event}
    Redis-->>Pub: Event ID
    
    Note over Redis: Event persisted
    
    Redis->>Rabbit: Forward to topic exchange
    Rabbit->>Rabbit: Route by event type
    
    par Parallel Delivery
        Rabbit->>Sub1: Deliver event (Queue 1)
        Rabbit->>Sub2: Deliver event (Queue 2)
        Rabbit->>Sub3: Deliver event (Queue 3)
    end
    
    Sub1->>Sub1: Process event
    Sub1->>Rabbit: ACK
    
    Sub2->>Sub2: Process event
    Sub2->>Rabbit: ACK
    
    Sub3->>Sub3: Process failed
    Sub3->>Rabbit: NACK + Requeue
    
    Note over Rabbit: Retry Sub3
    Rabbit->>Sub3: Redeliver event
    Sub3->>Sub3: Process success
    Sub3->>Rabbit: ACK
    
    Note over Redis: Event available for replay
    Sub1->>Redis: XREAD (replay events)
    Redis-->>Sub1: Historical events